# Prettier already skips anything in .gitignore (dist/, .astro/, node_modules/).
# These are tracked or untracked paths it would otherwise rewrite.
#
# NOTE: prettier-plugin-tailwindcss is pinned to ^0.7.4 (i.e. < 0.8) on purpose.
# In 0.8.1 its wrapper around prettier-plugin-astro's `astro` parser loses the
# parser's `astFormat`, so Prettier falls back to the built-in HTML printer and
# silently rewrites every .astro file to "<object></object>" — reporting success
# while doing it. Do not widen that range without re-testing `npm run format`
# on a throwaway .astro file first.

# Remember plugin session state — machine-written, not source.
.remember/

# Lockfile is npm's to format.
package-lock.json
